  <!-- Skip Link -->
  <div class="seo-answer"><strong>Direct answer:</strong> Mind Grace Neuropsychiatric Clinic in Greater Noida offers three assessment pathways — psychiatric evaluation, psychological assessment, and child and learning assessment — each planned around the specific question you need answered, with fees from ₹500 to ₹8,000 depending on the pathway.</div>
<main id="main-content" class="seo-page"><section class="seo-hero"><p class="seo-kicker">Assessment and evaluation</p><h1>Assessment that answers a useful question</h1><p class="seo-lead">Mind Grace Neuropsychiatric Clinic in Greater Noida provides psychiatric evaluation, psychological testing, and child and learning assessments for adults, children, and families. An assessment is most helpful when it begins with a clear concern and ends with understandable recommendations—not just a label or a score.</p><div class="seo-actions"><a class="btn" href="/book">Ask about an assessment</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/fees">Review assessment fees</a></div></section><section class="seo-section"><h2>Assessment pathways</h2><div class="seo-grid"><article class="seo-card"><h3>Psychiatric evaluation</h3><p>A clinician reviews symptoms, history, health, and functioning to guide diagnosis and next steps.</p></article><article class="seo-card"><h3>Psychological assessment</h3><p>Structured interviews or tests may help understand cognition, behaviour, emotions, or learning.</p></article><article class="seo-card"><h3>Child and learning assessment</h3><p>ADHD, autism, developmental, learning, and school concerns are considered in the child’s wider context.</p></article></div><div class="seo-note"><strong>Scope note:</strong> The assessment plan, tools, number of sessions, and report format depend on the referral question and clinical judgement.</div></section><section class="seo-section"><h2>Prepare with context</h2><p>Bring previous reports, school feedback, medication details, and your questions where available. Read <a href="/process">what to expect</a> before booking.</p></section>    
  </main><script type="application/ld+json">{"@id": "https://mindgracencr.in/#clinic"}</script>
